---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Received" subtitle="Your words reached the inbox.">
  <p>
    That is all that has happened. Your message is in John's inbox — not on the
    site. Nothing publishes on submission.
  </p>

  <p>
    If it is taken, the reply is machine-drafted, any canon in it quoted from
    SuttaCentral and never from memory, and read and <strong>signed by John</strong>{' '}
    before it appears. Not everything is answered, and not everything is
    published. If you left an email, that is where a reply would reach you; it is
    never published or shared.
  </p>

  <p class="back">
    <a href="/">Return to the front</a><span class="sep">·</span
    ><a href="/writings/">Keep reading</a>
  </p>
</Layout>

<style>
  .back {
    margin-top: 2.75rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }
  .back a {
    color: var(--brass);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
  }
  .back a:hover {
    border-bottom-color: var(--brass);
  }
  .sep {
    margin: 0 0.7em;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
  }
</style>
